## AI checklist (realtime feature)

1. Confirm this is **not** chat → use `ws.vtc.com`, not `chat.vtc.com`
2. Add env vars to `env_development` + `.env.production`
3. Pass JWT on connect — token from VTC shell `?token=` / localStorage, not hardcoded env
4. Rooms-based isolation; no custom Socket.IO namespaces
5. Copy socket config API pattern from `newsfeed` if browser needs runtime URL
6. Server emits: JWT from request when using shared relay; prod may use internal `SOCKET_IO_URL` — never expose internal IP to client
7. Multiplayer via LobbyNet → read `multi-user-games.mdc` first
